From 1bbf641cf1a0527c5f78db4a2bc13673a2c353e8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jianwen Wu <229805785+JianwenWuu@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 16:06:01 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign homepage in a quiet, Loro Piana-inspired style
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Ivory page, brick-red accent, red/rose double stripe under a top news bar,
  centered serif name with section links beneath (sticky, highlights the
  current section)
- About section: introduction on the left, 4:5 portrait on the right with an
  ivory caption card; research interests and "– Link –" style profile links
- News, Publications (figure on a sand panel, own name bolded, equal
  contribution marked), Education and Experience side by side, Moments
- Self-hosted Newsreader + Tenor Sans fonts (OFL) via next/font/local
- Content stays in data/*.ts; bio and news accept [link](url) and *italics*
- New favicon and social preview image (og.jpg)
- Remove unused ProjectCard and Reveal components

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Nr3GXqjnYzMkb7ise5N7Qd
